      "text": "this breakdown nails the depth of what @zama_fhe is building\nbigger picture: privacy rewritten as default, not an afterthought\nFHE means\nsmart contracts run on encrypted data\nAI models learn and predict without touching your raw info\nany L1/L2 can plug in without a new chain or language\nprivacy by design isn’t a feature, it’s the baseline for the next wave\nthe Zama Creator Program turns cryptography into deployable power\ntestnets, real-world dApps, and education that actually matters\n#ZamaCreatorProgram | gZama @zama_fhe",
