        "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/Jikymeow/status/1975605906097512674",
        "text": "This breakdown by @__Iamcrown really shows the depth of what @zama_fhe is building\nBut here’s the bigger picture: Zama is rewriting the rules of privacy\nFHE means\nsmart contracts run on encrypted data\nAI models learn and predict without touching your raw info\nany L1/L2 can plug in without a new chain or new language\nprivacy won’t be an afterthought in Web3  with Zama, it’s default\nprivacy by design isn’t a feature, it’s the baseline for the next wave\nthe Zama Creator Program is turning cryptography into deployable power\ntestnets, real-world dApps, and education for builders that actually matters\n#ZamaCreatorProgram | gZama\n@zama_fhe",
